    {
      "index": 0,
      "voice": "samantha",
      "rate_pct": 0,
      "text": "Welcome back to the show everyone, today we have a special guest with us.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.984,
      "duration_ms": 3984,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "voice": "samantha",
      "rate_pct": 0,
      "text": "We are going to talk about a really interesting topic that has been getting a lot of attention lately.",
      "start": 4.484,
      "end": 9.502,
      "duration_ms": 5018,
      "pause_after_ms": 700,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "voice": "alex",
      "rate_pct": 10,
      "text": "That is right, and I am really excited to dive into this. It is something I have been following for a while now.",
      "start": 10.202,
      "end": 25.343,
      "duration_ms": 15141,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "voice": "alex",
      "rate_pct": 15,
      "text": "So tell us, what is your take on the whole situation?",
      "start": 25.943,
      "end": 33.382,
      "duration_ms": 7439,
      "pause_after_ms": 1000,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": -10,
      "text": "Well, that is a great question. I think there are a few key aspects we need to consider here.",
      "start": 34.382,
      "end": 44.313,
      "duration_ms": 9931,
      "pause_after_ms": 800,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": -15,
      "text": "First of all, the technology itself has evolved significantly over the past few years, and that has changed the landscape quite a bit.",
      "start": 45.113,
      "end": 59.346,
      "duration_ms": 14233,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": -10,
      "text": "But I also think we need to be careful about how we approach some of the challenges that come with it.",
      "start": 59.846,
      "end": 69.254,
      "duration_ms": 9408,
      "pause_after_ms": 1200,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "voice": "samantha",
      "rate_pct": 0,
      "text": "That is a really good point.",
      "start": 70.454,
      "end": 71.834,
      "duration_ms": 1380,
      "pause_after_ms": 300,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "voice": "samantha",
      "rate_pct": 5,
      "text": "Could you elaborate a bit more on what you mean by challenges?",
      "start": 72.134,
      "end": 77.383,
      "duration_ms": 5249,
      "pause_after_ms": 800,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "voice": "alex",
      "rate_pct": 20,
      "text": "Yeah, I was wondering the same thing. Like, what are the main hurdles you see?",
      "start": 78.183,
      "end": 88.576,
      "duration_ms": 10393,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": -10,
      "text": "Sure. So one of the biggest challenges is making sure the system handles edge cases properly.",
      "start": 89.176,
      "end": 99.453,
      "duration_ms": 10277,
      "pause_after_ms": 700,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": -5,
      "text": "For example, when you have multiple speakers with very different speaking styles, the timing can be tricky to manage.",
      "start": 100.153,
      "end": 112.844,
      "duration_ms": 12691,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": -5,
      "text": "And then there is the issue of pauses. Natural conversation has all sorts of pauses.",
      "start": 113.344,
      "end": 122.592,
      "duration_ms": 9248,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": 0,
      "text": "Some are short, some are long, and they all serve a purpose in communication.",
      "start": 122.992,
      "end": 127.567,
      "duration_ms": 4575,
      "pause_after_ms": 2500,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "voice": "samantha",
      "rate_pct": 0,
      "text": "That is fascinating. I never really thought about pauses that way before.",
      "start": 130.067,
      "end": 134.036,
      "duration_ms": 3969,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "voice": "samantha",
      "rate_pct": 5,
      "text": "So how do you think this impacts the overall listening experience for the audience?",
      "start": 134.536,
      "end": 142.463,
      "duration_ms": 7927,
      "pause_after_ms": 700,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "voice": "alex",
      "rate_pct": 15,
      "text": "Honestly, I think most people do not notice it consciously, but they feel it.",
      "start": 143.163,
      "end": 153.981,
      "duration_ms": 10818,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "voice": "alex",
      "rate_pct": 20,
      "text": "If the pacing is off, the whole thing just feels off.",
      "start": 154.381,
      "end": 161.367,
      "duration_ms": 6986,
      "pause_after_ms": 800,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": -5,
      "text": "Exactly. And that is why getting the timing right is so crucial for a natural sounding result.",
      "start": 162.167,
      "end": 172.332,
      "duration_ms": 10165,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "voice": "daniel",
      "rate_pct": 0,
      "text": "It is the difference between something that sounds like a robot reading a script, and real people having a real conversation.",
      "start": 172.932,
      "end": 179.797,
      "duration_ms": 6865,
      "pause_after_ms": 800,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "voice": "alex",
      "rate_pct": 15,
      "text": "Alright, well that is all we have time for today.",
      "start": 180.597,
      "end": 187.293,
      "duration_ms": 6696,
      "pause_after_ms": 300,
      "total_duration": 197.2
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
